        "\n",
        "![](images/superbowl_table.png){fig-align=\"center\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "In this case, the CSS element is `.data-table`.\n",
        "\n",
        "## \n",
        "\n",
        "We retrieve the table using the `select()` function."
