        "## Data wrangling\n",
        "\n",
        "</br></br>\n",
        "\n",
        "To make the data easier to work with, we will create a separate column for the year.\n",
        "\n",
        "To do this, we use the `str.split()` function from **pandas**."
      ],
      "id": "12074406"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "\n",
        "superbowl_data_wr = superbowl_data.copy()\n",
